  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICSP Programme, implemented by Tr&#xf3;caire and partners in the Balaka, Chikwawa and Machinga districts of Malawi, works towards the goal that women and older adolescent girls experience increased safety, psychosocial wellbeing, and meaningful participation and leadership. This objective supports women, older adolescent girls and GBV survivors to use GBV specialised interventions and psychosocial support to meet their needs and preferences. Activities include training service providers on the GBV legal framework and psychosocial support; roll out of cultural and social norms change programming.  The principal focus of this outcome is:

Women&#x2019;s protection and access to specialised GBV supports</narrative>
  </description>
